{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven timeless solitaire games return with bold visuals, playful twists, and flexible rules. Settle in for a slow, strategic session or sneak in a quick match - the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/5d9a2c78be1be5dbb93a779ff591a565.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The demo includes <strong>two full games with no limits or paywalls</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>Magical Gathering</strong> and <strong>Club Calculus</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enjoy <strong>Klondike (Magical Gathering)</strong>, the world\u2019s most popular solitaire, fully playable with endless challenge even without buying the full version.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Also included is <strong>Calculation\u00a0(Club Calculus</strong>), a skill-based, Art Deco\u2013styled solitaire variant.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/bf7853d84303653c654e2f3a5654bc0c.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/2c864591835a4d3d57e6688d5288e9b6.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/2c864591835a4d3d57e6688d5288e9b6.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/2c864591835a4d3d57e6688d5288e9b6.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf83 <strong>Magical Gathering</strong> \u2013 Klondike with a touch of sorcery. Four unique suits -\u00a0<strong>crystals, evil pumpkins, skulls, and potions</strong>. Skeletons rise to join the witches, each striving to prove who truly wields the night\u2019s power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Deck Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>one, two, or three decks</strong> for customizable challenge levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Distinct Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard</strong>: Traditional Klondike rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful</strong>: Every tableau card is visible, rewarding careful planning.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Dealing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>1, 2, or 3 cards per draw</strong> to fine-tune difficulty and pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/9544dd1ad93f7efb9382d41e9daf49f7.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/99312d3fb51d3ca207a99a4707130611.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/99312d3fb51d3ca207a99a4707130611.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/99312d3fb51d3ca207a99a4707130611.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb7 <strong>Club Calculus</strong> - Calculation solitaire in sleek Art Deco flair. A dazzling lounge of <strong>hard-working hustlers, smoky-eyed musicians, sharp-suited mafia, and glittering socialites</strong> all converge under golden lights to test their wits and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Pile Count</strong><br>Play with <strong>4, 5, or 6 piles</strong> to set your perfect level of challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Calculation Rules</strong><br>Master the timeless solitaire variant where quick thinking meets bold strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/ca428ab49a8dd611cb8547e683ad4851.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/3505a72f802cb5b030d48a1c5e1f46ea.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/3505a72f802cb5b030d48a1c5e1f46ea.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/3505a72f802cb5b030d48a1c5e1f46ea.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Age of Warriors</strong> - FreeCell with a clash of legendary warriors. <strong>Mongols, viking raiders, noble samurai, and gallant knights</strong> stand as the four commanding suits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Options</strong><br>Conquer with <strong>one or two full decks</strong>, tailoring the scale of your campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic FreeCell Gameplay</strong><br>Every card visible from the start - victory demands pure skill and foresight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/f9697dc5f40592f9706f2941d538a1f3.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/bdcc6e1861815a4ded47fbad2e149a53.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/bdcc6e1861815a4ded47fbad2e149a53.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/bdcc6e1861815a4ded47fbad2e149a53.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Family Reunion - Osmosis solitaire steeped in eerie gothic charm. Meet the <strong>red eccentric family, grey indifferent family, green trembling family, and blue melancholic family</strong>, each suit a branch of a delightfully unsettling lineage gathering under moonlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Play Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard</strong>: Classic osmosis challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful</strong>: All piles visible for strategic plotting.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Deals</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw <strong>1, 2, or 3 cards per turn</strong> to set your own level of tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/b998598a101552813f6fce92954acbdb.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/f4f8500a1f329d06aef10532075d78ee.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/f4f8500a1f329d06aef10532075d78ee.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/f4f8500a1f329d06aef10532075d78ee.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc11\u00a0<strong>Farm Commotion</strong>\u00a0- Spider solitaire under a restless night sky. The suits are <strong>wolves, foxes, chickens, and lambs</strong>, each stirring in the moonlit fields as the farm comes alive after dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Deck Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>one, two, or three decks</strong> for the challenge you crave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard</strong>: Classic spider solitaire rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful</strong>: All tableau cards visible for strategic play.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color Choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>full color</strong> or <strong>black-and-white</strong> for a striking nocturnal mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/880f9921c0c73b5fef00ad77a991d96a.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/34e41114f664f02b76f6c029ae370bbd.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/34e41114f664f02b76f6c029ae370bbd.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/34e41114f664f02b76f6c029ae370bbd.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf54 <strong>Bad Habits</strong>\u00a0- Yukon solitaire in the mischievous style of a 1920s cartoon. The suits are <strong>fast food, alcoholic drinks, cigarettes, and gambling</strong>, each drawn with rubber-hose charm and a wink of vintage vice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Yukon Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All tableau cards are visible from the start for bold, strategic moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Pile Movement</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how stacks move:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternating colours, desc &amp; asc order</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternating colours, descending only</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Same suit, desc &amp; asc order (Alaska Solitaire variant)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Same suit, descending only (Russian Solitaire variant) </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/01e235c47214d108d44441c1457ab130.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The \u201cZoo\u201d solitaire game is still in development.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd93 <strong>Zoo</strong>\u00a0- A playful memory-matching card game set in a lively zoo. A table of cards is dealt <strong>face down</strong>, and your goal is to <strong>flip and find matching animal pairs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Versus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>alone</strong> to test your memory or <strong>with a friend</strong> for head-to-head pair-finding fun.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Pair-Finding Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your memory by uncovering two matching animals at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively tougher layouts keep every round fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Footage not yet available\u00a0-\u00a0</strong>the zoo gates are still being built, but the animals are already restless! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven beloved solitaire games, each with unique themes and optional rule variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty, deck sizes, and deal settings for a fully custom challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct art styles ranging from gothic elegance to roaring-\u201920s mischief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music and optional Thoughtful Modes for players who savor strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replay value - perfect for a quiet evening or a quick five-minute break<br></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re craving quiet contemplation or a burst of nostalgia, <strong>Timeless Solitaire Collection</strong> is your endlessly replayable card companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Magic Worshipper","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029350/8ac18248972aa33c3219e9c72b35167b2945dcab.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Apprentice","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029350/17cce7a3a86771b9739d4fe93b123bc4ee2a569d.jpg"},{"name":"Magic Adept","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029350/8cf3d4d24aec89fae629204e59301571004b3bfc.jpg"},{"name":"Sorcerer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029350/d364ff8639b3acacf8fd46f6e3ef33789d14f240.jpg"},{"name":"Laborer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029350/e01836b9886604d89c592e93fcaf4a62f85e8499.jpg"},{"name":"Bohemian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029350/ec3665faaa7d6c715df31376e091791136e90f1c.jpg"},{"name":"Socialite","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029350/54a9695dca99dea42f2cd5e7e24c8eadb270fe8c.jpg"},{"name":"Mafia Boss","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029350/4b6ff0c4458a5f74c117c0fa3ec676d2e948542d.jpg"},{"name":"Mongol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029350/6e73a0f7e7c8c029f2ea69341853095159243d37.jpg"},{"name":"Knight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4029350/7a5e3438830e3bab22636a4c8f84935dce450ff9.jpg"}],"total":28},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029350?t=1772710312","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4029350?t=1772710312","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/44ee0beaf4c4620324b491340e04eae9aacbf9ea/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772710312","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/44ee0beaf4c4620324b491340e04eae9aacbf9ea/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772710312","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4149650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven timeless solitaire games return with bold visuals, playful twists, and flexible rules. Settle in for a slow, strategic session or sneak in a quick match - the choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/5d9a2c78be1be5dbb93a779ff591a565.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The demo includes <strong>two full games with no limits or paywalls</strong>\u00a0-\u00a0<strong>Magical Gathering</strong> and <strong>Club Calculus</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Enjoy <strong>Klondike (Magical Gathering)</strong>, the world\u2019s most popular solitaire, fully playable with endless challenge even without buying the full version.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Also included is <strong>Calculation\u00a0(Club Calculus</strong>), a skill-based, Art Deco\u2013styled solitaire variant.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/bf7853d84303653c654e2f3a5654bc0c.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/2c864591835a4d3d57e6688d5288e9b6.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/2c864591835a4d3d57e6688d5288e9b6.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/2c864591835a4d3d57e6688d5288e9b6.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf83 <strong>Magical Gathering</strong> \u2013 Klondike with a touch of sorcery. Four unique suits -\u00a0<strong>crystals, evil pumpkins, skulls, and potions</strong>. Skeletons rise to join the witches, each striving to prove who truly wields the night\u2019s power. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Deck Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>one, two, or three decks</strong> for customizable challenge levels.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Distinct Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard</strong>: Traditional Klondike rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful</strong>: Every tableau card is visible, rewarding careful planning.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flexible Dealing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose <strong>1, 2, or 3 cards per draw</strong> to fine-tune difficulty and pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/9544dd1ad93f7efb9382d41e9daf49f7.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/99312d3fb51d3ca207a99a4707130611.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/99312d3fb51d3ca207a99a4707130611.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/99312d3fb51d3ca207a99a4707130611.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb7 <strong>Club Calculus</strong> - Calculation solitaire in sleek Art Deco flair. A dazzling lounge of <strong>hard-working hustlers, smoky-eyed musicians, sharp-suited mafia, and glittering socialites</strong> all converge under golden lights to test their wits and style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Pile Count</strong><br>Play with <strong>4, 5, or 6 piles</strong> to set your perfect level of challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Calculation Rules</strong><br>Master the timeless solitaire variant where quick thinking meets bold strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/ca428ab49a8dd611cb8547e683ad4851.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/3505a72f802cb5b030d48a1c5e1f46ea.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/3505a72f802cb5b030d48a1c5e1f46ea.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/3505a72f802cb5b030d48a1c5e1f46ea.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Age of Warriors</strong> - FreeCell with a clash of legendary warriors. <strong>Mongols, viking raiders, noble samurai, and gallant knights</strong> stand as the four commanding suits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deck Options</strong><br>Conquer with <strong>one or two full decks</strong>, tailoring the scale of your campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic FreeCell Gameplay</strong><br>Every card visible from the start - victory demands pure skill and foresight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/f9697dc5f40592f9706f2941d538a1f3.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/bdcc6e1861815a4ded47fbad2e149a53.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/bdcc6e1861815a4ded47fbad2e149a53.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/bdcc6e1861815a4ded47fbad2e149a53.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd6f\ufe0f Family Reunion - Osmosis solitaire steeped in eerie gothic charm. Meet the <strong>red eccentric family, grey indifferent family, green trembling family, and blue melancholic family</strong>, each suit a branch of a delightfully unsettling lineage gathering under moonlight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Play Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard</strong>: Classic osmosis challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful</strong>: All piles visible for strategic plotting.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Deals</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draw <strong>1, 2, or 3 cards per turn</strong> to set your own level of tension.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/b998598a101552813f6fce92954acbdb.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/f4f8500a1f329d06aef10532075d78ee.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/f4f8500a1f329d06aef10532075d78ee.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/f4f8500a1f329d06aef10532075d78ee.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc11\u00a0<strong>Farm Commotion</strong>\u00a0- Spider solitaire under a restless night sky. The suits are <strong>wolves, foxes, chickens, and lambs</strong>, each stirring in the moonlit fields as the farm comes alive after dark.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Deck Options</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play with <strong>one, two, or three decks</strong> for the challenge you crave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Two Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Standard</strong>: Classic spider solitaire rules.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Thoughtful</strong>: All tableau cards visible for strategic play.</p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Color Choice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between <strong>full color</strong> or <strong>black-and-white</strong> for a striking nocturnal mood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/880f9921c0c73b5fef00ad77a991d96a.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/34e41114f664f02b76f6c029ae370bbd.poster.avif?t=1772710312\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/34e41114f664f02b76f6c029ae370bbd.webm?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/34e41114f664f02b76f6c029ae370bbd.mp4?t=1772710312\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf54 <strong>Bad Habits</strong>\u00a0- Yukon solitaire in the mischievous style of a 1920s cartoon. The suits are <strong>fast food, alcoholic drinks, cigarettes, and gambling</strong>, each drawn with rubber-hose charm and a wink of vintage vice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Yukon Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All tableau cards are visible from the start for bold, strategic moves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Pile Movement</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose how stacks move:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternating colours, desc &amp; asc order</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alternating colours, descending only</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Same suit, desc &amp; asc order (Alaska Solitaire variant)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Same suit, descending only (Russian Solitaire variant) </strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/extras/01e235c47214d108d44441c1457ab130.webp?t=1772710312\" width=600 height=50 /></span></p></li></ul></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>The \u201cZoo\u201d solitaire game is still in development.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd93 <strong>Zoo</strong>\u00a0- A playful memory-matching card game set in a lively zoo. A table of cards is dealt <strong>face down</strong>, and your goal is to <strong>flip and find matching animal pairs</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo or Versus</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play <strong>alone</strong> to test your memory or <strong>with a friend</strong> for head-to-head pair-finding fun.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic Pair-Finding Gameplay</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your memory by uncovering two matching animals at a time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressively tougher layouts keep every round fresh.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa5 <strong>Footage not yet available\u00a0-\u00a0</strong>the zoo gates are still being built, but the animals are already restless! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">\u2728 <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seven beloved solitaire games, each with unique themes and optional rule variations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjustable difficulty, deck sizes, and deal settings for a fully custom challenge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Distinct art styles ranging from gothic elegance to roaring-\u201920s mischief</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing music and optional Thoughtful Modes for players who savor strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless replay value - perfect for a quiet evening or a quick five-minute break<br></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re craving quiet contemplation or a burst of nostalgia, <strong>Timeless Solitaire Collection</strong> is your endlessly replayable card companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Thought Kraken"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4029350/31437c3dae9d6db045d3140169161a6ab23c133c/header.jpg?t=1772710312","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04+ or SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2+ Cores, 2+ GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB VRAM, OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 24.04+ or SteamOS<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2+ Cores, 2+ GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 2 GB VRAM, OpenGL 3.3<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS High Sierra<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo @ 1.86 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</stro